OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a few light showers
OL,6,Fat first. Otherwise it will be dry
OL,7,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and a
OL,8,Ffew sunny intervals, best of any
OL,9,Fsunshine across the northwest. Light
OL,10,Fnortheasterly wind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry and
OL,13,Fpartly cloudy. Then becoming rather
OL,14,Fcloudy overnight with a few light
OL,15,Fshowers possible across Angus and
OL,16,FFife. Light and variable winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,19,Fcloudy at times. Chance of a few light
OL,20,Fshowers, these mainly across Angus,
OL,21,FFife and Dundee.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
